[
  {
    "id": 1007001030010,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "はぁ、はぁ、はぁ……！　……ひー……やっと休憩だ……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charCategory": "stand_jersey",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "007",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00014",
    "bgm": "012",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫か？",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……ああ、プロデューサー……三峰はもうダメだよ……\r\n全然力が湧いてこなくって……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "かなりハードなレッスンだしな……\r\nもうちょっと頑張れるか？",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "もう……もうダメ、もう限界……\r\nあの店の……ケーキがないと……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あの店？",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……この前の、ラジオの収録の帰りに見かけた\r\n美味しそうなお店……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……あの店のケーキさえあれば、きっと……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……本当に疲れてるんだよな？",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "もしかしてプロデューサー、三峰のことを疑ってるの……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "純粋無垢で……真面目な性格でおなじみの三峰の\r\nささやかなお願いを、嘘だって言うの……！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あんまり覚えがない属性ばっかり出てるけど",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、わかったよ\r\n今日のレッスンが終わったら連れていく。約束だ",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ほんと？　やったー！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "現金だなぁ……",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、落ち込んでなさそうで良かったよ\r\n今日来てくれてるトレーナーさん、厳しいことで有名だから",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そうなんだ？　でも、言うこと的確だし、\r\n三峰的には全然嫌じゃないよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だったらなおさら、しっかりついていくといい\r\nあの人、見込みのある相手にしか厳しくしないって話なんだ",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華はあの人に見込まれるだけの何かを持ってるんだよ\r\n自信を持って頑張ってこい",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……いや～、三峰の隠れた才能、発見されちゃいました？\r\n新たな三峰、開花しちゃう？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "はー、自分が怖いなぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は楽しみにしてるよ。結華がどこまで成長するのか",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あらら、楽しみにされちゃったか。それじゃ仕方ないなぁ、\r\nいっちょ張りきって……ってもうこんな時間",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "休憩終了！　行ってきますかね……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（明るく振舞ってはいるけど、\r\nやっぱり少し疲れてるよな……）",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……なあ、結華",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "もう少し、休憩時間を\r\n延ばしてもらおうか？",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "才能を隠し持った\r\n結華なら楽勝だよな？",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "今頑張れば、ケーキに\r\nコーヒーもつけよう",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030140,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "？　大丈夫だよ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、まだ疲れは取れきってないだろ？\r\n休憩を延長できないか掛け合うくらいなら、俺から……",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "プロデューサーは心配性だなぁ、三峰なら平気だって\r\n普段が省エネだしね、たまにはこのぐらい負荷かけなきゃ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "それに、ペーペーがそんな生意気なこと言えないでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それはそうだけど──",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030170,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "まだ心配？　でもさ、",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030180,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰、やればできるじゃないか！\r\nさすがだ！　俺は絶対できると思っていたぞ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030190,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "って、あのトレーナーさんに言ってもらえたら面白くない？\r\n実は三峰、それ狙ってんだよね",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……確かに、あの人にそんなこと言ってもらえたら、\r\n痛快だろうな",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030200,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "でしょ？\r\nだからＰたん、今は止めなくて大丈夫だよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030210,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "いざとなったらすぐ甘えるから、そしたら守って？\r\nじゃ、いってきます！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030220,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "やだ、三峰の株爆上がりしてる？\r\nこれは大暴落する前にレッスンに戻らなきゃですね～",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030230,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "プロデューサーは人をやる気にさせるのが上手いなぁ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなんじゃないよ\r\n俺は本当に結華の可能性を信じてるんだ",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "しっかり開花させてきてくれ",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030240,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "はいはーい",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030250,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……あ、でも、眠れる獅子のままの方が\r\n二つ名的にはかっこいいか？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いいわけないだろ、眠ったままじゃ困る",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030260,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "うそうそ。ちゃんと頑張ってくるよ\r\nＰたん、応援ありがとねー",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030270,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "お？　ここで賭け金の上乗せとは\r\nプロデューサーも勝負に出たね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030270"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030280,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "でもあの店、いい豆使ってるから結構お高いんだよー？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030280"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030290,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "Ｐたんの薄いお財布がさらに薄くなっちゃうけど……\r\n大丈夫？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "本音を言えばちょっと困る……が、\r\nそれで結華のレッスンが上手くいくなら安いもんだ",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030300,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "Ｐたん……いいえ、プロデューサー……！\r\nその気持ち、確かに受け取りました……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030300"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030310,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰、全力で頑張ってくるね！\r\nケーキとコーヒー頼み放題の恩に報いるために！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え。いや、ちょっと待て！\r\nそこまでは言ってな──あ、おいっ！",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001030320,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "先に言っとくね、ごちそうさま、プロデューサー！\r\n張りきっていってきまーす！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700103/1007001030320"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]